/**
 * Market packs.
 *
 * Pre-portioned "soup packs" are how a lot of Nigerian households already buy
 * from the market woman: everything for one pot, measured out. Each pack is a
 * single cart line with its own price; `value` is what the same portions cost
 * bought separately, so the saving shown is real arithmetic, not a slogan.
 */

